msgid "The cooler draws its own information screen with these CPU values; the theme's look cannot be sent (no safe live image transfer)."
msgstr "Kælirinn teiknar eigin upplýsingaskjá með þessum örgjörvagildum; ekki er hægt að senda útlit þemans (engin örugg sending lifandi mynda)."

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/displays/deepcool/metrics.py:128
msgid "This theme needs live images, which the cooler cannot receive safely; it keeps its information screen."
msgstr "Þetta þema þarf lifandi myndir, sem kælirinn getur ekki tekið við á öruggan hátt; hann heldur upplýsingaskjánum sínum."

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/displays/deepcool/metrics.py:132
msgid "The firmware shows its fixed CPU fields; the theme's choices do not change them."
msgstr "Fastbúnaðurinn sýnir sína föstu örgjörvareiti; val þemans breytir þeim ekki."

#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/bsmd/displays/deepcool/models.py:19
#: usr/share/big-screen-monitor-display/deepcooltray/app.py:168
